  "A wandering ascetic who wishes to stay celibate, until he finds his ancestors (Pitris) hanging head-down in a pit for want of descendants (§13, §45–§46). He agrees to marry only a namesake whom he need not maintain (§13–§14, §46–§47). He weds Vasuki's sister Jaratkaru, then leaves her when she wakes him at sunset and so offends him; he assures her that she has conceived (§47).",
  "austere|irascible|principled","curt|stern|dutiful",
