  "Vasuki's sister; wife of the Rishi Jaratkaru; mother of Astika",
  "Raised by Vasuki for the Rishi (§39). She is given to Jaratkaru the Rishi (§14, §47). Torn between his sleep and the time of his evening prayer, she wakes him; he leaves her (§47). She tells Vasuki that she carries the child who will save the snakes (§48), and she gives birth to Astika (§48).",
